      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        82.57861328125,
        513.4718627929688,
        97.19511413574219
      ],
      "text": "1)\t Group 1 first-line oral drugs Use any   (see Table 9) that have certain, or almost",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        96.98809814453125,
        513.4375610351562,
        110.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "certain, efficacy, for example, drugs showing susceptibility in DST. These drugs",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        110.7880859375,
        360.2919006347656,
        124.13958740234375
      ],
      "text": "should be administered for the duration of therapy.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        129.9815673828125,
        513.4835205078125,
        144.5980682373047
      ],
      "text": "2)\t Group 2 injectable agent  Add one  based on DST results and treatment history.",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        144.39105224609375,
        513.5065307617188,
        157.7425537109375
      ],
      "text": "This agent is normally given for a minimum of 6 months and for 4 months after",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        158.1910400390625,
        513.4837036132812,
        171.54254150390625
      ],
      "text": "culture conversion. Preferably, it should be an aminoglycoside such as amikacin. Do",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        171.99102783203125,
        513.4719848632812,
        185.342529296875
      ],
      "text": "not use streptomycin (unless other Group 2 drugs are unavailable) because of high",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        185.791015625,
        465.04547119140625,
        199.14251708984375
      ],
      "text": "rates of resistance with DR-TB strains and higher incidence of ototoxicity.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        204.9844970703125,
        513.4374389648438,
        219.6009979248047
      ],
      "text": "3)\t Group 3 fluoroquinolone Add one   based on DST results and treatment history, for",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        219.39398193359375,
        513.4489135742188,
        232.7454833984375
      ],
      "text": "the duration of therapy. Levofloxacin and moxifloxacin are preferred to ofloxacin.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        233.1939697265625,
        327.89642333984375,
        246.54547119140625
      ],
      "text": "Note that ciprofloxacin is not recommended.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        252.387451171875,
        513.483642578125,
        267.0039367675781
      ],
      "text": "4)\t Group 4 second-line oral drugs  should be added for the duration of therapy,",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        266.79693603515625,
        513.4835815429688,
        280.1484375
      ],
      "text": "until there are at least four drugs in the regimen to which the isolate is likely to be",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        280.596923828125,
        513.4490356445312,
        293.94842529296875
      ],
      "text": "susceptible. The Group 4 drugs should be chosen on the basis of treatment history,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        294.39691162109375,
        472.5550231933594,
        307.7484130859375
      ],
      "text": "adverse effect profile and cost. DST is not standardized for Group 4 drugs.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        313.59039306640625,
        513.4605712890625,
        328.2068786621094
      ],
      "text": "5)\t If a regimen of four effective drugs cannot be built from Groups 1-4, consider",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        327.723876953125,
        513.4257202148438,
        341.35137939453125
      ],
      "text": "Group 5 third-line  adding, in consultation with an MDR-TB expert, at least two",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        109.14340209960938,
        342.12188720703125,
        356.0369567871094,
        355.7493896484375
      ],
      "text": "drugs.  DST is not standardized for Group 5 drugs.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        364.39739990234375,
        435.0304260253906,
        377.7489013671875
      ],
      "text": "Drug groups used to treat drug-resistant TB are summarized in Table 9.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "69",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}